{"repositoryId":1054976413,"availability":"available","full":"sudheeshps/dotnetdupe","name":"dotnetdupe","description":"A modern, cross-platform C++ Base Class Library (BCL) bringing the elegance, productivity, and familiar APIs of .NET to C++.","category":"Productivity","language":"C++","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2025-09-11T15:33:51Z","updated":"2026-10-15T06:13:53Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://sudheeshps.github.io/dotnetdupe/","topics":[],"demo":"https://sudheeshps.github.io/dotnetdupe/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T11:21:09.021Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T11:21:09.021Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T11:21:09.021Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T11:21:09.021Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Ever admired the elegance and developer-friendliness of .NET APIs? 🤔 While the C++ Standard Template Library (STL) is powerful, its learning curve can be steep. This project, DotNetDupe, bridges that gap! 🌉","Inspired by the clear and concise API design of C# .NET, DotNetDupe is a C++ library that brings a familiar, streamlined development experience to your C++ projects. ✨","Latest Published Version ([]( Comprehensive documentation, API reference updates, Pimpl ABI stability, and refined packaging! 🌐 Key highlights include: - 💾 Drive Metrics & Free Space Telemetry (System::IO::DriveInfo): Full drive metrics, file system format, volume label, total size, and available/free space queries via DriveInfo::GetDrives(), GetTotalSize(), GetTotalFreeSpace(), and GetAvailableFreeSpace(). - 📂 Recursive Directory Searching (System::IO::Directory & SearchOption): Added SearchOption::TopDirectoryOnly and SearchOption::AllDirectories overloads to Directory::GetFiles,…"],"features":["🧠 Memory & Object Management (System):","SmartPointer: Exception-safe RAII reference-counted smart pointer with NewShared() and NewUnique() factory helpers.","Base Object type system with T